WEBVTT

00:09.342 --> 00:12.595
2,302 Ohba gyoza.

00:13.388 --> 00:16.641
2,303 Ohba gyoza.

00:17.392 --> 00:20.687
2,304 Ohba gyoza.

00:23.690 --> 00:27.819
I can't sleep at all. Too much on my mind.

00:28.486 --> 00:32.824
Counting gyoza just makes me hungry
and isn't helping at all.

00:42.792 --> 00:44.210
There's 100 nicks!

00:44.294 --> 00:49.174
Good job! We can get spare change
from this vending machine every night.

00:49.674 --> 00:51.718
One more job after the shift.

00:51.801 --> 00:56.097
I guess even sorcerers can be broke.

00:56.181 --> 00:58.224
Wait, they're Cross-Eyes?

01:00.060 --> 01:01.061
Without a doubt.

01:05.148 --> 01:06.524
What?

01:08.485 --> 01:10.528
Who the hell are you?

01:13.073 --> 01:15.033
I'm

01:16.076 --> 01:18.661
a friend of Risu's.

02:48.001 --> 02:49.961
THE BEGINNING

02:51.212 --> 02:52.964
En...

02:54.674 --> 02:57.468
Hey, I heard Mr. En collapsed?

02:57.552 --> 03:00.096
Shin! And Noi!

03:00.180 --> 03:03.683
What's this?
You guys are humans from the Hole.

03:03.766 --> 03:05.226
Hello!

03:06.769 --> 03:09.522
They're acquaintances of mine.
Leave them be.

03:09.606 --> 03:10.899
I see.

03:10.982 --> 03:12.483
Hey, where's Nikaido?

03:12.567 --> 03:18.239
Actually, up until now, Nikaido has been
me in disguise. You didn't realize that?

03:18.323 --> 03:19.741
What?!

03:19.824 --> 03:24.370
The real Nikaido ran away
with the lizard guy.

03:24.454 --> 03:26.372
I wonder where they are now.

03:26.456 --> 03:30.126
So that's what happened.
You did it, Caiman.

03:33.296 --> 03:34.297
En woke up!

03:34.380 --> 03:36.674
- Boss! Are you okay?!
- Boss!

03:36.758 --> 03:40.887
En! Thank goodness!

03:42.513 --> 03:44.015
Mr. Chota!

03:51.522 --> 03:54.692
By any chance, are you going
to where Nikaido is?

03:55.276 --> 03:58.196
The contract inside me is guiding me.

03:58.696 --> 04:01.157
I'll get rid of the lizard guy myself.

04:01.658 --> 04:03.826
You follow along after me later!

04:16.965 --> 04:17.966
Caiman?

04:20.176 --> 04:21.344
Hey!

04:21.427 --> 04:24.305
Ebisu, are you here?

04:30.603 --> 04:31.437
Ebi--

04:37.026 --> 04:38.027
Ebisu.

04:38.528 --> 04:40.822
- Fujita.
- Ebisu!

04:42.949 --> 04:43.992
Ebisu!

04:48.371 --> 04:49.372
Ebisu!

05:11.477 --> 05:14.355
That monster! Ebisu! Hold on!

05:14.439 --> 05:17.066
I'll get Noi here as soon as I can!

05:29.787 --> 05:32.790
It's no good. My magic won't work.

05:38.546 --> 05:40.965
Is this the black powder?

05:41.049 --> 05:42.592
Crap!

05:50.808 --> 05:52.352
You're a friend of Risu's?

05:53.478 --> 05:55.855
You're not Aikawa, are you?

05:55.938 --> 05:58.358
Aikawa?

06:06.574 --> 06:08.159
What's that?

06:08.659 --> 06:10.244
Dokuga, Tetsujo!

06:10.328 --> 06:12.497
We're in trouble. En is here!

06:12.580 --> 06:15.875
- Is he coming for us?
- We haven't been paid yet!

06:15.958 --> 06:18.378
This isn't the time to say such a thing!

06:19.128 --> 06:22.131
- Dokuga! What are you doing? Let's go!
- Right.

06:22.215 --> 06:23.508
What is it?

06:23.591 --> 06:27.512
No, it's just that guy
seemed familiar somehow.

06:32.975 --> 06:34.894
What's happening?

06:34.977 --> 06:38.272
Big Bro! Nikaido!

06:41.984 --> 06:43.611
Nikaido!

06:44.487 --> 06:45.738
Caiman.

06:45.822 --> 06:47.782
Nikaido! What's wrong?

06:47.865 --> 06:49.867
My chest hurts.

06:50.368 --> 06:52.495
En is nearby.

06:52.995 --> 06:56.165
All right, I'll carry you.
We're getting out of here.

07:23.943 --> 07:26.571
It's been a while, Nikaido.

07:26.654 --> 07:27.780
En.

07:28.406 --> 07:31.701
So you're the lizard guy.

07:32.201 --> 07:34.579
I'm here to get my partner back.

07:35.663 --> 07:36.998
Perfect timing!

07:37.081 --> 07:37.999
Caiman!

07:38.082 --> 07:41.210
Because I'm not the type to run away.

07:41.294 --> 07:44.213
I'll kill you, mushroom bastard!

07:44.297 --> 07:45.882
If you die,

07:45.965 --> 07:49.469
the magic from Nikaido's contract
will be dispelled.

07:50.219 --> 07:54.098
Come on. I'll tear you apart
so you'll never revive.

07:54.182 --> 07:57.768
No matter how amazing a Sorcerer you are,

07:57.852 --> 08:02.023
magic doesn't work on me!

08:19.457 --> 08:21.876
What, are you done already?

08:23.127 --> 08:27.465
You think my mushrooms
are some dumb magic.

08:27.965 --> 08:30.885
But you have no idea
how terrifying it really is.

08:31.636 --> 08:33.804
This is also revenge for Matsumura.

08:34.388 --> 08:37.308
I'll kill you
in the most agonizing way possible.

08:37.391 --> 08:39.143
Go ahead and try!

08:44.482 --> 08:49.570
It does seem to be true
that my magic cannot affect your flesh.

08:52.114 --> 08:54.492
But I don't even have to cast it on you.

08:54.575 --> 08:58.788
I can release tiny spores
that will produce mushrooms.

08:58.871 --> 09:01.123
What are you going on about?

09:01.207 --> 09:02.959
Come at me now!

09:03.042 --> 09:04.961
It's already over.

09:05.044 --> 09:06.003
What?

09:06.504 --> 09:10.967
The spores I told you about
are invading your body,

09:11.050 --> 09:13.719
going further and further in.

09:14.720 --> 09:15.596
Caiman!

09:15.680 --> 09:17.598
And then they'll begin to grow.

09:30.778 --> 09:31.988
Don't worry.

09:32.947 --> 09:35.992
I took down that monster with my magic.

09:36.492 --> 09:37.493
It's all right.

09:38.703 --> 09:44.125
I'll beg En as hard as I can
to let us use Kikurage's magic.

09:44.208 --> 09:46.377
It's only now that's painful.

09:47.086 --> 09:50.381
The next time you wake up,
you won't feel any pain.

10:02.059 --> 10:04.979
Our dear Mr. En's putting on a show again.

10:05.062 --> 10:06.397
That troublemaker!

10:21.537 --> 10:23.497
You shouldn't be so reckless.

10:23.581 --> 10:27.793
If you damage those mushrooms,
it'll be the same as damaging your leg.

10:28.544 --> 10:33.090
Still, even though the contract
hasn't fully regenerated yet,

10:33.174 --> 10:35.551
I'm surprised you managed to attack me.

10:36.302 --> 10:38.721
Is this man really that important to you?

10:38.804 --> 10:45.186
Yes, he is important.
He's my one and only precious friend.

10:46.270 --> 10:47.938
An opening!

10:53.194 --> 10:54.111
Caiman?

10:54.695 --> 10:57.531
Crap, that really hurts.

10:57.615 --> 11:01.118
How dare he grow mushrooms in my body!

11:04.622 --> 11:08.459
You bastard!

11:08.959 --> 11:10.878
Die!

11:12.963 --> 11:14.340
Caiman!

11:17.093 --> 11:19.261
Your face...

11:27.978 --> 11:29.021
Caiman.

11:32.608 --> 11:34.777
Cai...man...

11:41.200 --> 11:44.328
I wanna eat some gyoza.

11:44.829 --> 11:46.038
Dammit.

11:52.211 --> 11:57.007
You were killed by someone else, not me.

12:05.391 --> 12:08.310
FAREWELL, CAIMAN

12:10.438 --> 12:11.647
Caiman.

12:12.148 --> 12:15.568
So that was your real face.

12:16.986 --> 12:19.405
You finally turned back to normal.

12:21.407 --> 12:24.827
Do you remember yesterday's promise?

12:26.287 --> 12:28.581
Let's go back to the Hole together.

12:31.125 --> 12:33.169
Okay, Caiman?

12:36.046 --> 12:37.673
Good grief.

12:38.174 --> 12:41.969
Mr. En did say
to collect the lizard guy's corpse,

12:42.762 --> 12:45.055
but how am I supposed to look for it?

12:45.556 --> 12:51.520
Caiman, it can't be.
Were you really killed?

12:51.604 --> 12:53.564
Hey, Mr. Kasukabe!

12:54.064 --> 12:55.900
Look at this.

12:56.817 --> 12:59.320
- Impressive.
- Shocking!

12:59.403 --> 13:03.073
So there used to be magma
flowing around here.

13:03.157 --> 13:04.366
That's...

13:05.409 --> 13:08.454
Caiman's head?

13:13.959 --> 13:16.170
BURNING HEART

13:22.009 --> 13:24.094
En doesn't seem to have followed us.

13:24.178 --> 13:29.391
I see. But we should probably
hang out here for a while longer.

13:30.476 --> 13:32.269
What's wrong, Dokuga?

13:33.604 --> 13:35.773
I was thinking about the boss.

13:38.818 --> 13:39.860
Me too.

13:40.361 --> 13:44.532
Lately, I've been remembering a lot.
I wonder if I mentioned it to you.

13:45.199 --> 13:48.410
The boss and I once went
to this place in Dung Hill

13:48.494 --> 13:51.163
where elite Sorcerers hung out.

13:51.789 --> 13:55.709
The guy running the place
was sitting in the very back.

13:55.793 --> 13:59.255
The moment he locked eyes
with the boss, he passed out.

14:00.005 --> 14:04.802
Wait a sec! If we're sharing
that kind of story, I've got one too.

14:06.262 --> 14:10.933
One time, our food-greedy boss actually
took pity on me and gave me a hamburger!

14:11.016 --> 14:15.312
That's only because you were staring at it
like you hadn't eaten in days.

14:16.730 --> 14:17.565
Dokuga?

14:18.315 --> 14:22.027
I was remembering the day
I first met the boss.

14:23.779 --> 14:29.451
We were young and had no real purpose.
We just lived our lives day by day.

14:30.786 --> 14:35.583
Questioning our worth
because we couldn't use magic,

14:35.666 --> 14:39.086
we had to steal food just to survive.

14:40.421 --> 14:42.339
You brats!

14:42.423 --> 14:43.716
How do we off 'em?

14:45.718 --> 14:46.969
What is this spit?

14:47.052 --> 14:50.222
Stupid brat!
I'll cut your mouth right out!

14:50.306 --> 14:51.432
Stop it!

14:52.349 --> 14:53.267
Tetsujo!

14:53.350 --> 14:56.478
You stupid Sorcerers!
What do you think you're doing?

14:56.562 --> 15:01.025
Hey, I decided
how I'm going to execute these brats.

15:01.609 --> 15:04.278
The Hole. Let's throw them in the Hole.

15:10.743 --> 15:11.577
Dokuga?

15:11.660 --> 15:13.370
This pain in my body...

15:14.622 --> 15:20.169
The sorcerer's blood inside me
is rejecting the Hole's rain.

15:20.252 --> 15:22.546
It proves that we were Sorcerers.

15:22.630 --> 15:25.799
- Dokuga...
- That's it! You're right!

15:28.093 --> 15:29.929
What's with these kids?

15:35.935 --> 15:39.730
The boss took down those Sorcerers
and went through the Door.

15:41.148 --> 15:44.568
And we followed as if we were drawn to it.

15:46.320 --> 15:50.532
After that,
the number of people like us increased,

15:50.616 --> 15:52.743
and the organization grew larger.

15:53.619 --> 15:55.496
Where's the boss now?

15:56.747 --> 15:58.999
Big Bro! Where are you?

15:59.083 --> 16:03.504
Big Bro! Nikaido! Where are you?

16:22.398 --> 16:23.273
Who are you?!

16:34.868 --> 16:36.537
Why are you...

16:38.622 --> 16:40.290
Me?

17:04.148 --> 17:06.025
What's your name?

17:06.108 --> 17:07.067
Natsuki.

17:08.360 --> 17:13.574
I came here to see the boss with Caiman,
my lizard-faced Big Bro.

17:13.657 --> 17:15.826
Caiman? Never heard of him.

17:15.909 --> 17:17.828
I see.

17:17.911 --> 17:23.083
Big Bro didn't know where the hideout was,
and his Cross-Eye mark disappeared.

17:23.167 --> 17:25.335
He was probably an impostor.

17:25.419 --> 17:29.840
But even if he was a fake Cross-Eye,
I'm still worried.

17:31.425 --> 17:32.509
What is it?

17:32.593 --> 17:33.844
Look at that!

17:36.180 --> 17:38.348
My name is Curse.

17:38.432 --> 17:41.477
I'm the most sinister thing in this realm.

17:42.061 --> 17:46.106
Don't look at me. Don't speak my name.

17:47.024 --> 17:49.359
Who the hell are you?

17:49.943 --> 17:50.986
Stop!

17:51.070 --> 17:52.738
You monster!

18:00.245 --> 18:01.413
Tetsujo!

18:01.497 --> 18:02.706
Ton, stop!

18:07.169 --> 18:09.254
Everyone, don't attack him.

18:09.338 --> 18:13.050
Don't even think about killing.
You'll get yourselves killed.

18:26.688 --> 18:30.859
I am Curse, the one who takes everything.

18:40.953 --> 18:45.374
I was turned back into a Sorcerer,
and my powers have weakened.

18:46.250 --> 18:49.753
I was only able
to somehow bring him with me.

18:50.420 --> 18:52.256
But he's not breathing,

18:52.339 --> 18:57.052
and he's really cold.

19:02.850 --> 19:05.352
MEMORY BUBBLES

19:17.447 --> 19:18.532
I'm back.

19:18.615 --> 19:20.909
Welcome back. So you've returned.

19:20.993 --> 19:23.662
Yeah, it's fine now.

19:23.745 --> 19:28.167
I think maybe it's for the best
I don't remember who or what I am.

19:29.835 --> 19:30.919
I see.

19:33.505 --> 19:35.549
First, let's have a drink.

19:35.632 --> 19:37.050
And some gyoza too!

19:37.134 --> 19:38.427
Yeah, I know.

19:43.765 --> 19:44.933
Nikaido?

19:48.228 --> 19:49.980
I'll help too.

19:53.025 --> 19:54.443
Nikaido?

19:56.320 --> 19:59.740
Caiman. Why?

20:00.532 --> 20:01.533
Nika--

20:03.577 --> 20:04.703
What?

21:22.489 --> 21:24.658
I had a bad dream.

21:25.951 --> 21:28.161
A dream where I killed someone.

21:28.662 --> 21:31.623
Someone special to me.

21:33.333 --> 21:35.877
Something like this happened before.

21:39.923 --> 21:41.049
What did you say?

21:42.301 --> 21:44.303
"My name"?

21:47.848 --> 21:49.308
What was it?

21:51.059 --> 21:54.313
I'm sure this will come in handy.

21:54.396 --> 21:55.564
All right, hurry!

22:00.277 --> 22:03.530
What? He left?

22:04.031 --> 22:06.825
And he changed
because he stayed here too long?

22:10.412 --> 22:11.246
Stop!

22:11.330 --> 22:13.457
I found out something amazing!

22:13.540 --> 22:15.959
- Risu!
- Nothing's confirmed yet, though.

22:16.043 --> 22:16.960
It's no good!

22:27.554 --> 22:29.931
She manipulates time.

22:35.937 --> 22:39.608
Let me just die like this.

24:16.705 --> 24:17.914
THE END

24:17.998 --> 24:19.875
What we learned in Episode 6.

24:19.958 --> 24:22.627
Caiman finally meets
the remaining Cross-Eyes.

24:22.711 --> 24:24.504
Ebisu is quite the delinquent.

24:24.588 --> 24:26.548
The Cross-Eyes' boss
is an imposing figure.

24:26.631 --> 24:31.011
What we'll learn in Episode 7
is still hidden in chaos.

24:31.094 --> 24:32.929
This is Dorohedoro.
